Adds an approve command. Approve actions can be specified in .grapeconfig and include creating a tag, updating a merge/pull request description, and approving the merge/pull request. Approve inputs can be specified in .grapeconfig for information that should be added to the merge/pull request description or tag message.

For what a review rule looks like in the .grapeconfig, see https://rzlc.llnl.gov/gitlab/GRP/test_application_1/-/merge_requests/5/diffs.

